== Behavior ==
{{Sectionstub}}
The '''Wiki Tiki''' moves towards players and sprays a ring of damaging fire particles from the top head.

Periodically, the '''Wiki Tiki''' summons {{MobSprite|Wiki Tiki Laser Totem}}s that are {{mt|Shielded}} and have {{Stat|hp|5}}. They spin in place with a laser that damages players for {{Stat|Damage|8,000}}. While the laser totem is active, the '''Wiki Tiki''' cannot be damaged. Attempting to damage the '''Wiki Tiki''' in this state sends the following message in chat:

{{Dialogue|&aThe Wiki Tiki is &c&lIMMUNE! &aAttack its &elaser totems&a!}}

Occasionally, the '''Wiki Tiki''' compacts. While compacting, {{InfoNeeded}} blocks around it temporarily convert into {{ID|Lime Terracotta!{{Green|Lime}}|nolink=yes}}, {{ID|Yellow Terracotta!{{Yellow|Yellow}}|nolink=yes}}, {{ID|Orange Terracotta!{{Gold|Orange}}|nolink=yes}}, and {{ID|Red Terracotta!{{Red|Red}}|nolink=yes}} Terracotta. Players still within the area after it reaches {{ID|Red Terracotta!{{Red|Red}}|nolink=yes}} will take damage.

