== Notes ==
*The '''Wiki Tiki''' has {{Green|90%}} resistance to magic damage.
*{{MobSprite|Wiki Tiki Laser Totem;Wiki Tiki Laser Totems}} can only be damaged by true melee attacks, not abilities that deal melee damage.<!-- confirmed for Soul Whip/Flaming Flay, not sure about Flower of Truth/Bouquet of Lies -->
<!-- *The '''Wiki Tiki''' cannot be corrupted by a {{Item|Totem of Corruption}}, but its Laser Totems can be. -->
* The '''Wiki Tiki'''{{'}}s [[Bestiary]] entry connects it to the Kalhuiki tribe found in the {{Zone|Jungle}} that {{MobSprite|Kalhuiki Tribe Member}}s, {{MobSprite|Kalhuiki Elder}}s, {{MobSprite|Kalhuiki Youngling}}s, and {{NPCSprite|Odawa}} are part of.

